{"server":"tw","storyId":"act15d0_level_act15d0_06_end","groupId":"act15d0","stageId":"act15d0_06","title":"制定計劃","storyCode":"MB-6","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act15d0/level_act15d0_06_end.txt","sourceHash":"ee3d3635ea06879020404c6059820fb1d5e08577ee8eb5f544765f8f33e0a6f6","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bar_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"一個從沒長時間離開過監獄這樣的地方的人，確實會對外界產生恐懼呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，幸好我知道結局，她也一起出來了，不然我聽到這裡可要開始著急了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"真是太好了~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"於是在那之後應該就是籌備越獄的時間了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"安東尼決定越獄時，大概是卡夫卡進入監獄一個半月左右的時候，而後，他們花了一個多月的時間才最終制定好了可實行的越獄計畫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是說，完成制定計劃時距離實際越獄的時間還有一個半月了嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"四個月的時間說短不短，說長倒也確實不長呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，說了這麼久，終於到我最感興趣的部分了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"......這張圖紙是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我懂了，是監獄的平面圖吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯~雖然比較粗糙，不過基本上該有的都有了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"我最好奇的部分，當然是逃獄的方法啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然隊伍中每個人的故事我也挺感興趣，但是一說到越獄，果然還是越獄本身最精彩吧~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"難道說你想瞭解整個過程，真的只是因為你對越獄感興趣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以這麼認為哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"......好吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ac15_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"既然要講，還是從頭講起吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"首先，這座監獄採用了一些移動城市的設計經驗，並沒有直接基於底盤在上面搭建監獄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"它是先仿造現實地貌製造了一塊人造山體，並在那之上完成的監獄設計。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然這在現在已經是相當常見的技術，不過以當時的眼光來看，是相當超前且成功的做法。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ac15_5"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，監獄的外觀先略過不談。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"監獄一共三層，每一層的結構都比較類似。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"每一層左下角的這一塊是A區，也就是非感染者牢房區。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"而右上角的則是B區，感染者牢房區。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"左上和右下兩個角落都是警衛室，裡面還有休息的地方，平時獄警通常都在那裡活動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"而中間的這個黑色的方形就是關押重犯的C區塔。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ac15_5_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"中間這一塊是地下工廠，也就是犯人們共同作業的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"這邊是醫務室，也就是杜瑪的房間，而隔壁就是停屍間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"另一邊是安東尼提議建立的圖書館。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"結構大致就是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"在經過米娜一段時間的摸索後，他們大致掌握了監獄的結構，並想出了一個越獄的方法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ac15_5_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"你看結構可以發現，C區的塔其實並不只是在地面上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"它不僅中間有電梯可以通往地下，塔本身其實也是有下沉結構的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"誒誒誒，還有這樣的結構啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，這樣的建築結構還挺少見的。這麼設計的理由應該是為了方便在緊急情況下能夠將重犯關在地下，以免他們鬧事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，而控制塔下沉的機關，平時需要兩個警備室裡的機關共同作用才能生效。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"我事後得知的一些邊角情報裡確實提到了塔下沉了這回事，所以他們是在警衛室啟動了機關吧？......咦，不對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"就算他們進入了地下，但是地下並沒有能夠逃出去的地方啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"......首先，他們並沒有去警衛室，雖然這確實是最早的方案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，他們得知，警衛室的機關只能控制塔以比較緩慢的速度下沉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"......安東尼是在一份放在圖書館裡的資料上發現的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"那份資料應該是建造監獄時遺留的一些設計圖，可能是沒人在意，所以在安東尼提議建造圖書館後，就乾脆被隨手放在那裡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"噗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"大概也是覺得沒有人能拿這個幹什麼吧，而且畢竟這座監獄也建造了有二十多年了我記得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"二十五年。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"總之，等待塔緩慢下沉是不行的，獄警們必然已經反應過來了，所以這個方案最終被否決了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？這樣的話，那......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"幸好他們在那份資料上還發現了一樣東西，那就是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ac15_5_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"中間的這座塔頂，你看，這裡還有一層不是監獄的房間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"事實上，這裡才是這座塔，甚至是這座監獄真正的主控室。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"主控室......原來如此，在這裡可以讓塔快速地下沉，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯。而且還可以控制監獄中的電路，製造一些短暫的混亂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"而這一層平時是沒有人的，想要進入這一層，需要特殊的電梯鑰匙，一般獄警配備的鑰匙卡是無法進入這一層的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"我大致明白了，他們透過主控室快速讓塔下沉來到了地下，並透過斷電給地面上製造了許多混亂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"但是這樣還是有一個問題——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"然後呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"難道地下有逃出去的路？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"有的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ac15_5_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"這條路是杜瑪提供的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"據她回憶，上一任的入殮師提到過，這座監獄由於沒有經驗可以參考，所以在山體下其實留了一些被廢棄的結構。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"這之中有一些是能夠通往監獄外的地表的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"而其中有一條，就相當靠近停屍間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅爾","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然說很近，其實中間也隔著至少3米的牆體就是了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"難道說是......挖？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，挖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然房間的牆壁都是用鋼筋混凝土製成的，但是外面畢竟是泥土。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"只要能找到比較脆弱的牆壁，打穿後不需要非常先進的工具也能進行挖掘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"在不引起懷疑的前提下，他們會輪流來到醫務室挖掘地道。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ac15_5_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，這麼說來，既然在停屍間挖，那麼直接挖好之後離開不行嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"你忘了嗎，在沒有停靠城市時，即使來到監獄外的地表也沒有什麼用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"而一旦停靠在城市時，獄警們也都會提高警備，囚犯們的自由時間會被極端壓縮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"即使是安東尼也幾乎沒有自由時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"直接像平時那樣前往醫務室是不行的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"也對，誒嘿，我忘了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，因為已經停靠城市了，米娜在越獄之前就跟著施工團隊離開了，所以她並沒有實際參與這次越獄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"她是在監獄外和卡夫卡他們會合的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"總之，在最後的一個半月裡，他們首先從獄警隊長巴頓那裡偷來了能夠通往塔頂層的鑰匙卡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"然後終於在下一次停靠前幾天，挖通了地道，並且確認確實是可以通往地面的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫默","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"一切都已經準備就緒。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_108_silent","aliases":["赫默"]},{"speakerId":"char_242_mayer","aliases":["梅爾"]},{"speakerId":"char_249_muesys","aliases":["繆爾賽思"]}]}
